WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.520
NASA’s support for cargo demonstrations and SpaceX’s later booster landing are two chapters in the same company history.

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:13.040
Aug 2006. NASA backs commercial cargo demonstration work.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:16.920
Dec 2010. Dragon returns from orbit.

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:21.400
Dec 2015. SpaceX lands an orbital-class booster.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:27.200
The full timeline follows the recovered booster’s later flight and the development of crewed missions.
